        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1313L  Dome Style Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis domed style upright floor stop is very easy to install. Packaged with a mounting anchor and rubber bumper ring.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDurable, modern, futuristic design, plus great protection for your door hardware and walls.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-1313L-size.jpg?v=1704354556\" width=\"438\" height'\"325\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 1313L door stop size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOnly 1 hole to drill for fast easy installation. The rubber bumper ring goes all the way around the door stop, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 1313L Modern Floor Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base to Bumper Center Height: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
